---
layout: base.njk
title: AI 遊樂場
description: 用 AI 做的小作品和 27 款網頁小遊戲：射擊、動作、益智、棋類、休閒，免安裝，手機也能玩。
permalink: /games/
---
{% import "cards.njk" as c %}
<section class="page-head">
  <h1>AI 遊樂場</h1>
  <p class="lead">跟 AI 一起做的小作品和小遊戲。遊戲共 {{ collections.games.length }} 款，直接在瀏覽器玩，手機也可以。</p>
</section>
{% if collections.works.length %}
<section class="lab">
  <div class="section-head"><h2>AI 小作品</h2><a href="/works/">全部 {{ collections.works.length }} 件 →</a></div>
  <div class="grid">{% for w in collections.works | first(3) %}{{ c.card(w, [w.data.kind, w.data.year]) }}{% endfor %}</div>
</section>
{% endif %}
<section class="page-head" style="padding-top:0">
  <h2>小遊戲</h2>
  {{ c.filters("gameGrid", collections.games | uniq("category")) }}
</section>
<div class="grid games" id="gameGrid">
  {% for g in collections.games %}{{ c.card(g, g.data.gameTags) }}{% endfor %}
</div>
